      <guid>https://littlego-usermanual.herzbube.ch/appendix/faq/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-toc gdoc-toc__level--6&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;nav id=&#34;TableOfContents&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#how-do-i-change-the-board-size&#34;&gt;How do I change the board size?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#how-do-i-start-a-new-game&#34;&gt;How do I start a new game?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#how-can-i-pass--play-a-pass-move&#34;&gt;How can I pass / play a pass move?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#what-are-the-functions-of-all-those-buttons&#34;&gt;What are the functions of all those buttons?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#the-computer-is-too-strong--too-weak-what-can-i-do&#34;&gt;The computer is too strong / too weak, what can I do?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#player-influence-is-not-displayed-or-is-completely-wrong-what-can-i-do&#34;&gt;Player influence is not displayed, or is completely wrong, what can I do?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#move-numbers--coordinate-labels-are-not-displayed-even-though-they-are-enabled-in-the-user-preferences&#34;&gt;Move numbers / coordinate labels are not displayed even though they are enabled in the user preferences&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#markup-labels-are-not-displayed&#34;&gt;Markup labels are not displayed&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#what-is-an-auto-created-player&#34;&gt;What is an &amp;ldquo;Auto-created player&amp;rdquo;?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/nav&gt;&#xA;      &lt;hr /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;flex align-center gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 id=&#34;how-do-i-change-the-board-size&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;        How do I change the board size?&#xA;    &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;    &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://littlego-usermanual.herzbube.ch/appendix/faq/#how-do-i-change-the-board-size&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: How do I change the board size?&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: How do I change the board size?&#34; href=&#34;#how-do-i-change-the-board-size&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You need to start a new game. See the next question.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Go rules</title>
      <link>https://littlego-usermanual.herzbube.ch/appendix/go-rules/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://littlego-usermanual.herzbube.ch/appendix/go-rules/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-toc gdoc-toc__level--6&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;nav id=&#34;TableOfContents&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#overview&#34;&gt;Overview&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#players&#34;&gt;Players&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#board&#34;&gt;Board&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#intersections&#34;&gt;Intersections&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#moves&#34;&gt;Moves&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#liberties&#34;&gt;Liberties&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#stone-groups&#34;&gt;Stone groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#suicide-rule&#34;&gt;Suicide rule&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#exception-to-suicide-rule&#34;&gt;Exception to Suicide rule&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#no-repetition-ko-rule&#34;&gt;No Repetition (ko) rule&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#life&#34;&gt;Life&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/nav&gt;&#xA;      &lt;hr /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;flex align-center gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 id=&#34;overview&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;        Overview&#xA;    &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;    &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://littlego-usermanual.herzbube.ch/appendix/go-rules/#overview&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Overview&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Overview&#34; href=&#34;#overview&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This help section contains only a barebones introduction to the rules of Go. For a more thorough treatment please visit one of the many websites dedicated to the game. For instance, an excellent resource is &lt;a&#xA;  class=&#34;gdoc-markdown__link&#34;&#xA;  href=&#34;https://senseis.xmp.net/&#34;&#xA;&gt;Sensei&amp;rsquo;s Library&lt;/a&gt; while another more hands-on interactive tutorial is available on &lt;a&#xA;  class=&#34;gdoc-markdown__link&#34;&#xA;  href=&#34;https://online-go.com/learn-to-play-go&#34;&#xA;&gt;online-go.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
